  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你能在文明的崩塌中幸存吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《僵尸末日：废土的最后日子》将你投入一个荒凉、充满不死生物的世界。文明已逝，空气有毒，大地正在崩塌。成群的僵尸四处游荡，仅存的几座建筑中也充满了危险……或是救赎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>需要服务器？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BisectHosting</span></a> 是游玩此整合包的最佳选择。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_promo2.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"251\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和朋友一起玩《僵尸末日》会有趣得多，但搭建服务器或处理卡顿可能会很烦人。我一直使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>，因为它稳定且运行流畅。如果你想尝试，可以通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>此链接</strong></span></a> 获得首月 25% 的折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_description.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☢️ 核心特性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧟 无情的僵尸</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感染者统治了世界，这得益于 Infectious Zombie Apocalypse、Zombie Island、Day Zombies Rebooted、More Zombie Villagers、Extra Zombie Drops 和 Keerdm's Zombie Apocalypse Essentials 等模组的支持。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感谢 Epic Siege Mod 和 AI Improvements，不死生物变得更聪明、更强大，且完全不知疲倦。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌍 真实的废土体验</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Lost Cities 用废弃的摩天大楼和破损的道路覆盖了大地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Wastelands of Baedoor 将生物群系重塑为废墟遍布、充满辐射的死亡地带。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tough As Nails 增加了硬核机制，如口渴、体温和季节变化。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧭 探索充满危险</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过 Additional Structures 和 Explorify – Dungeons &amp; Structures 发现被遗忘的遗迹、地牢和破碎的纪念碑。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">谨慎探索——许多地点都爬满了不死生物。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛡️ 为生存而战</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">装备武器，利用 Security Craft、Torchmaster 和 Corail Tombstone 保卫你的庇护所。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过 Farmer’s Delight、Comforts 和 Sophisticated Backpacks 保持物资供应。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌫️ 紧张的氛围</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">恐怖主题的着色器和音效，由 AmbientSounds、Enhanced Visuals、Sound Physics Remastered 以及 Insanity、Hysteria 或 Spooklementary 等着色器提供支持。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚙️ 稳定且优化</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过 ModernFix、FerriteCore、Radium Reforged、Clumps 和 Embeddium 进行重度优化，即使在大规模的僵尸群下也能保持流畅。<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/517/zombie-apocalypse-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/518/zombie-apocalypse-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/521/zombie-apocalypse-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p>",
